- Come on over. - Tomoya, Tomoya.

46
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:43,840
They're here. Good to see you.

47
00:01:44,540 --> 00:01:46,709
Hello, I'm singer Kim Jae Hwan. Nice to meet you.

48
00:01:46,710 --> 00:01:48,050
Nice to meet you.

49
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:52,749
- Ready, go. Hello, we are NEXZ. - Hello. We are NEXZ.

50
00:01:52,750 --> 00:01:54,790
- We are NEXZ. - We are NEXZ.

51
