You aren't in sync from the start.

52
00:01:56,390 --> 00:01:58,960
- You weren't in sync. Not at all. - They weren't in sync.

53
00:01:59,020 --> 00:02:00,089
Why weren't... Why weren't you in sync?

54
00:02:00,090 --> 00:02:01,666
It feels a bit awkward doing it in Japanese.

55
00:02:01,690 --> 00:02:03,430
Shall we try it in Korean, then?

56
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:05,700
- Two, three. Hello, we are NEXZ. - Hello, we are NEXZ.

57
00:02:06,460 --> 00:02:09,100
(They greet so smoothly.)

58
