- They speak Korean so well. - Wait, they're from Japan,

59
00:02:11,500 --> 00:02:12,900
but they're more in sync in Korean.

60
00:02:13,340 --> 00:02:16,309
When you greet in Korean, you don't even say "We are NEXZ."

61
00:02:16,310 --> 00:02:17,340
You say, "We're NEXZ."

62
00:02:20,180 --> 00:02:21,656
- You have to trail off at the end. - Right, right.

63
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:23,650
Anyway, Jae Hwan, you must have been busy lately,

64
00:02:23,720 --> 00:02:24,996
