68
00:02:34,190 --> 00:02:35,490
How many years did it take...

69
00:02:35,630 --> 00:02:37,760
- to reunite Wanna One? - About 7 or 8 years? Yes.

70
00:02:37,830 --> 00:02:38,876
- It has been so long. - Well,

71
00:02:38,900 --> 00:02:40,230
how about you, Jaemin and Chenle?

72
00:02:40,300 --> 00:02:41,620
Can you even imagine that at all?

73
00:02:41,670 --> 00:02:43,376
I have never imagined it. I really have never imagined it.

74
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:44,916
You guys are together every day, right?

75
00:02:44,940 --> 00:02:46,816
Right. But even if we were apart for 7 or 8 years,

76
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:48,470
- when we meet again, - Of course.

77
00:02:48,540 --> 00:02:50,586
- Wouldn't it be similar? - I think we would act the same.

78
00:02:50,610 --> 00:02:52,579
Because we have known each other for so long.

79
00:02:52,580 --> 00:02:53,610
- That is true. - Right.

80
00:02:53,810 --> 00:02:55,610
I hope you cherish this moment...

81
00:02:56,110 --> 00:02:57,480
and treasure your members.

82
00:02:57,550 --> 00:02:59,419
(He's so funny.)

83
00:02:59,420 --> 00:03:01,496
Why, did you not treasure them much when you were together?

84
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:02,950
Yes, I started having...

85
00:03:03,020 --> 00:03:04,059
- Any regrets? - some regrets like that.

86
00:03:04,060 --> 00:03:06,390
Yes, so when we meet now, I treat them better...

87
00:03:06,460 --> 00:03:07,540
- Treat them better. - Yes.

88
00:03:07,590 --> 00:03:08,759
And we get along...

89
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:10,120
- Do you? - much more comfortably.

90
00:03:10,190 --> 00:03:11,460
When you are too busy,

91
00:03:11,530 --> 00:03:12,976
