92
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:14,930
- Right, right. - Right.

93
00:03:15,100 --> 00:03:20,139
NEXZ, what kind of vibe did you expect from IDOL'S TABLE?

94
00:03:20,140 --> 00:03:23,579
Well, actually, you are seniors I really look up to,

95
00:03:23,580 --> 00:03:24,580
- Really? - Really?

96
00:03:24,581 --> 00:03:26,710
So honestly, I really don't know where to look.

97
00:03:27,310 --> 00:03:31,620
Tomoya, look at your own individual camera and give us a wink.

98
00:03:32,350 --> 00:03:33,789
(Winking)

99
00:03:33,790 --> 00:03:35,420
