100
00:03:36,250 --> 00:03:38,360
- That came out right away. - Right on cue.

101
00:03:38,420 --> 00:03:39,966
Didn't you all have a time when you could do it on cue?

102
00:03:39,990 --> 00:03:41,689
- That is true. - There was a time like that.

103
00:03:41,690 --> 00:03:43,890
- When we debuted... - This makes me reflect on myself.

104
00:03:44,230 --> 00:03:46,206
Should Chenle also give it a try for old times' sake?

105
00:03:46,230 --> 00:03:47,329
(You can do it, right?)

106
00:03:47,330 --> 00:03:49,450
Should Chenle also give it a try for old times' sake?

107
00:03:49,570 --> 00:03:51,840
- It came right out. - It came right out.

108
00:03:51,900 --> 00:03:53,716
Jaemin, please give it a try with the vibe of original soju.

109
00:03:53,740 --> 00:03:54,916
You know, the original soju with a red lid.

110
00:03:54,940 --> 00:03:56,140
Yes, there it is, there it is.

111
00:03:56,410 --> 00:03:57,479
There's the vibe of original soju.

112
00:03:57,480 --> 00:03:59,310
(Seductive wink)

113
00:03:59,510 --> 00:04:00,810
Nice.

114
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:03,280
Great. The atmosphere is so great today,

115
00:04:03,350 --> 00:04:05,950
