116
00:04:06,020 --> 00:04:08,250
We will now begin the Family Table time.

117
00:04:08,320 --> 00:04:09,950
- Sounds good. - All right.

118
00:04:10,020 --> 00:04:12,490
Shall we look at Jae Hwan's table first?

119
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:13,690
Got it.

120
00:04:13,830 --> 00:04:16,090
- His drawing skills. - I am so curious.

121
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:18,000
- But I am... - Yes.

122
00:04:18,100 --> 00:04:20,176
