123
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:22,730
- We already saw the worst version. - It's okay.

124
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:25,200
This is Jae Hwan's table.

125
00:04:25,670 --> 00:04:26,670
This is drawn well.

126
00:04:27,010 --> 00:04:28,530
You can tell what it is. You can tell.

127
00:04:29,010 --> 00:04:31,509
- You drew it well. - You'll be able to guess this.

128
00:04:31,510 --> 00:04:34,210
- Yes. - This is really good.

129
00:04:34,910 --> 00:04:37,980
- You recently discovered a food. - Bean sprouts?

130
00:04:38,050 --> 00:04:39,580
- Bean sprouts? - Not bean sprouts.

131
00:04:39,650 --> 00:04:43,020
- Cilantro. - Right, it's cilantro.

132
00:04:44,660 --> 00:04:46,160
He practically showers in cilantro.

133
00:04:46,220 --> 00:04:48,189
- He showers in cilantro? - I love it.

134
00:04:48,190 --> 00:04:49,289
I really like cilantro too.

135
00:04:49,290 --> 00:04:50,529
- I like it too. - I do too.

136
00:04:50,530 --> 00:04:52,060
Anyone here who dislikes cilantro?

137
00:04:52,130 --> 00:04:53,900
We always take it out.

138
00:04:53,970 --> 00:04:55,170
- I take it out too. - What?

139
00:04:55,700 --> 00:04:57,540
You are not old enough yet.

140
00:04:59,640 --> 00:05:01,110
He says we're not old enough.

141
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:03,416
You have to be in your late twenties to appreciate cilantro.

142
00:05:03,440 --> 00:05:04,916
Unless you are from Thailand, from what I have seen.

143
00:05:04,940 --> 00:05:06,216
In Thailand, what age do people start...

144
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:07,250
