145
00:05:07,310 --> 00:05:09,350
If you don't eat it as a kid, your mom scolds you.

146
00:05:09,410 --> 00:05:11,350
- You get scolded by your mom? - I mean...

147
00:05:11,980 --> 00:05:13,550
She says, "Don't be picky."

148
00:05:13,620 --> 00:05:14,719
Really?

149
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:16,450
"Who said you could pick out cilantro?"

150
00:05:16,750 --> 00:05:17,819
Right.

151
00:05:17,820 --> 00:05:19,140
It is kind of like kimchi for us.

152
00:05:19,190 --> 00:05:21,460
Yes, because it is in almost everything.

153
00:05:21,530 --> 00:05:23,530
Because almost all the food has cilantro in it.

154
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:24,880
Anyway, regarding the food,

155
00:05:24,930 --> 00:05:25,999
