225
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:37,399
Yes, that's right. It's tonkotsu ramen.

226
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:38,599
He even got the type right.

227
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:40,100
That's right. Even I see it now.

228
00:07:40,160 --> 00:07:42,400
- That's tonkotsu, for sure. - Well, we're originally...

229
00:07:42,430 --> 00:07:45,000
- from Fukuoka... - Fukuoka tonkotsu ramen is so good.

230
00:07:45,070 --> 00:07:46,439
So that's why I chose tonkotsu ramen.

231
00:07:46,440 --> 00:07:47,470
- Yes. - Right.

232
00:07:47,640 --> 00:07:49,909
- A bit light on the chashu, though. - A bit...

233
00:07:49,910 --> 00:07:51,180
The chashu is a bit...

234
00:07:51,980 --> 00:07:53,409
Can we get extra chashu here, please?

235
00:07:53,410 --> 00:07:56,079
(Here is the extra chashu.)

236
00:07:56,080 --> 00:07:58,220
Yes, tonkotsu ramen packs quite a punch, you know?

237
00:07:58,280 --> 00:08:02,190
- Right, when you eat it. - So, among the members,

238
00:08:02,490 --> 00:08:05,060
I do a lot of breaking, so I spin around like crazy.

239
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:07,860
That's part of the impact too.

240
00:08:07,930 --> 00:08:10,530
You're known as a top performer in NEXZ, after all.

241
00:08:10,630 --> 00:08:11,660
A b-boy.

242
00:08:11,730 --> 00:08:13,876
And you do breaking too. Thank you so much for the table.

243
00:08:13,900 --> 00:08:14,900
Yes, thank you.

244
00:08:17,170 --> 00:08:19,239
- I feel like seeing... - Wow, this is fun.

245
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:21,409
What represents each person...

246
00:08:21,410 --> 00:08:24,079
- helps us get to know them better. - So true.

247
00:08:24,080 --> 00:08:26,040
- Right? - Totally.

248
00:08:26,110 --> 00:08:27,156
Now, what is today's theme?

249
00:08:27,180 --> 00:08:29,650
Today, we went with the theme,

250
00:08:29,710 --> 00:08:31,650
