00:45:55,060 --> 00:45:57,190
- Good morning, good morning. - Nice to meet you.

1270
00:45:57,260 --> 00:45:58,620
(Today's highly anticipated theme)

1271
00:45:58,660 --> 00:46:00,500
It is none other than the taste of nostalgia,

1272
00:46:00,560 --> 00:46:02,330
school food.

1273
00:46:02,400 --> 00:46:04,569
This is my actual uniform. I brought it from Bali.

1274
00:46:04,570 --> 00:46:06,200
- So pretty. - Wait a minute.

1275
00:46:06,270 --> 00:46:07,516
Sung Woon, how old are you right now?

1276
00:46:07,540 --> 00:46:10,010
- You are past the age for uniforms. - Do I have to say it?

1277
00:46:10,070 --> 00:46:11,746
- Is it a secret? - Second place or third place?

1278
00:46:11,770 --> 00:46:13,186
- Always first in the whole school. - For real?

1279
00:46:13,210 --> 00:46:14,316
Jaemin looks like a good student.

1280
00:46:14,340 --> 00:46:15,810
Studying and I are not friends.

1281
00:46:15,880 --> 00:46:18,280
The one most likely to get caught sneaking snacks...

1282
00:46:18,650 --> 00:46:20,479
- Why me? - Wait a second.

1283
00:46:20,480 --> 00:46:22,096
Did you have an all-time favorite menu item?

1284
00:46:22,120 --> 00:46:24,090
- Cup tteokbokki. - Character bento boxes?

1285
00:46:24,150 --> 00:46:25,290
Pigeon eggs.

1286
00:46:26,190 --> 00:46:27,230
Chenle's taste is unusual.

1287
00:46:27,460 --> 00:46:28,736
Who here had milk handed out at school?

1288
00:46:28,760 --> 00:46:30,459
In Thailand, it is not milk. They give you soy milk.

1289
00:46:30,460 --> 00:46:32,730
- Right. Soy milk. - With a straw too.

1290
00:46:32,790 --> 00:46:33,930
I did that too.

1291
00:46:34,000 --> 00:46:35,960
I am 17-year-old trainee Ha Sung Woon.

1292
00:46:36,030 --> 00:46:37,276
Hey, what are you doing here at this hour?

1293
00:46:37,300 --> 00:46:38,469
Hey, let us have a quick bite.

1294
00:46:38,470 --> 00:46:40,270
It is really delicious. Prepare to be amazed.

1295
00:46:41,200 --> 00:46:42,776
Just having three kinds of this is more than enough.

1296
00:46:42,800 --> 00:46:44,746
Hey, is this all we need to do? It does not take ten minutes.

1297
00:46:44,770 --> 00:46:46,480
- This is good. - It looks delicious.

1298
00:46:46,540 --> 00:46:47,609
That looks so good.

1299
00:46:47,610 --> 00:46:49,850
(Sung Woon's recipe, summoning his memory, is revealed.)

1300
00:46:51,610 --> 00:46:52,780
It is really delicious.

1301
00:46:52,850 --> 00:46:53,996
A familiar taste, but it is delicious.

1302
00:46:54,020 --> 00:46:55,749
What should I do? What if this gets too famous?

1303
00:46:55,750 --> 00:46:57,270
(Don't miss next week's IDOL'S TABLE.)
